WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:02.501
-Guys, here's the thing.

00:00:02.501 --> 00:00:04.837
I wrote a kid's book.

00:00:04.837 --> 00:00:07.040
It's a picture book.
It's not a joke.

00:00:07.040 --> 00:00:08.975
[ Laughter ]

00:00:10.043 --> 00:00:12.045
Okay, yesterday I said
I wrote a kid's book,

00:00:12.045 --> 00:00:13.813
and I held it up,
and everybody laughed

00:00:13.813 --> 00:00:16.349
like it was gonna be
the start of some funny bit.

00:00:17.516 --> 00:00:19.719
So that's why
I'm bracing you now.

00:00:19.719 --> 00:00:21.954
I wrote a real book.

00:00:21.954 --> 00:00:23.222
Did I do the pictures?

00:00:23.222 --> 00:00:24.657
No.

00:00:28.227 --> 00:00:29.562
There you go.

00:00:29.562 --> 00:00:31.431
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:33.967 --> 00:00:35.734
And it's for kids.

00:00:35.734 --> 00:00:36.903
It is for kids,
if you have kids.

00:00:36.903 --> 00:00:38.771
My kids like it,
which is great.

00:00:38.771 --> 00:00:42.007
My publisher keeps telling me,
which is so exciting,

00:00:42.007 --> 00:00:44.144
it is the first
kids book ever --

00:00:44.144 --> 00:00:46.646
There have been books
with a bear or a rabbit.

00:00:46.646 --> 00:00:48.114
It's the first one with both.

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:49.816
[ Laughter ]

00:00:53.919 --> 00:00:55.422
Name one, Shoemaker!

00:00:55.422 --> 00:00:57.490
Name one.

00:00:57.490 --> 00:00:59.793
What? Okay, you don't
have a minute, you're out.

